Exod 13:1 , The firstborn are sanctified to God;
Exod 13:3 , The memorial of the passover is commanded;
Exod 13:11 , The firstlings of man and beast are set apart;
Exod 13:17 , The Israelites go out of Egypt, and carry Joseph's bones with them;
Exod 13:20 , They come to Etham;
Exod 13:21 , God guides them by a pillar of a cloud, and a pillar of fire.
